/**
 * Builds the three pricing cards from PRICING_CONFIG.plans (defined at the
 * very top of this script) and inserts them into #pricingGrid.
 *
 * The markup/styles generated here are an exact match for what used to be
 * hand-written HTML — same padding, same border, same badge position, same
