 * copies sitting side by side in the track — that's what makes the loop
 * seamless: once the animation has scrolled exactly one full copy's width
 * to the left, the second copy is sitting exactly where the first one
 * started, so it can snap back to x:0 and repeat forever without any
 * visible jump.
 */
