/**
 * postToSheet(url, dataObj)
 * Sends form data to a Google Apps Script Web App and returns its parsed JSON reply.
 *
 * Step by step:
 * - new URLSearchParams(dataObj) turns the plain {key:value} object into
 *   "key1=val1&key2=val2" format — this is "form data", same as a normal
